@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@
+v2.29 revision(2024/12/24):
+1.change name from vdk into rvd
+
+v2.29 revision(2024/11/12):
+1.add ufs and vdk storage
+
+v2.28 revision(2024/07/18):
+1.create package-file when unpack image
+
+afptool: v2.27 revision(2023/10/25):
+1.fix check env condition bug
+
+afptool: v2.26 revision(2023/05/26):
+1.fix parse env.img bug 
+
+afptool: v2.25 revision(2023/04/24):
+1.add -no-overlap-check option on packing image
+
+afptool: v2.24 revision(2023/02/15):
+1.fix userdata:grow bug on package-file
+
+v2.23 revision(2022/10/28):
+1.fix unpack multi-storage firmware bug
+2.reopen file and rewrite entrys to avoid unflush buffer data 
+
+v2.22 revision(2022/08/08):
+1.support new format multi-storage firmware
+
+v2.21 revision(2022/08/04):
+1.support div placeholder on merging multi-storage firmware
+
+v2.2 revision(2022/03/28):
+1.support to create env firmware
+
+v2.1 revision(2022/03/09):
+1.support to compile on mac
+
+v2.0 revision(2021/08/16):
+afptool:
+1.fix bug when place normal item after replicated item in the package-file
+rkImageMaker:
+1.support input storage info
diff --git a/rockdev/rk3308-package-file-amp b/rockdev/rk3308-package-file-amp
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..ce67e38
--- /dev/null
+++ b/rockdev/rk3308-package-file-amp
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# NAME		Relative path
+#
+#HWDEF		HWDEF
+package-file	package-file
+bootloader	Image/MiniLoaderAll.bin
+parameter	Image/parameter.txt
+uboot		Image/uboot.img
+trust		Image/trust.img
+amp			Image/amp.img
+rootfs		Image/rootfs.img
+# 要写入backup分区的文件就是自身（update.img）
+# SELF 是关键字，表示升级文件（update.img）自身
+# 在生成升级文件时，不加入SELF文件的内容，但在头部信息中有记录
+# 在解包升级文件时，不解包SELF文件的内容。
+backup		RESERVED
+#update-script	update-script
+#recover-script	recover-script
